+++ b/releasenotes/notes/async-with-attempt-d109fa2535e12d98.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    The attempt object yielded by ``AsyncRetrying`` now supports the async
+    context manager protocol, so ``async with attempt:`` can be used inside
+    ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(...)`` loops. It behaves exactly like
+    ``with attempt:``.
